							</h2>
							<span class="rounded-full bg-[#86EFAC]/25 px-3 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#14532D] dark:text-[#86EFAC]">
								0 Bytes Network Egress
							</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-sm text-[#2A1155]/80 dark:text-slate-300">
							Test client-side semantic retrieval in the browser. Enter a technical query below to compute real-time <code>Float32Array</code> cosine similarity against our pre-indexed Web AI &amp; Architecture corpus right on your device.
